See AGENTS.md at the repo root for the full SERAPH rules, stack, and
invariants. This file exists only as a fallback for teammates on Windsurf
builds that predate Devin Desktop / native AGENTS.md reads.

Critical invariants if AGENTS.md somehow isn't loading:
- PILLAR_ORDER = ["hawkes", "rmt", "hamilton"] is fixed everywhere.
- docs/SPEC.md and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md win over existing code on any
  conflict. Never invent values for anything marked [GAP]/OQ — check
  docs/SERAPH-BUILD-ROADMAP.md §4, else ask.
- docs/archive/SPEC-DELTA-01.md is superseded historical material — do not
  treat it as current spec.
- seraph/shared_types/ — ask before editing; every component imports from it.
